// Known findings of `cargo xtask silice check` on the imported Silice data (SIL1 Task B).
// Each entry: the rule, the subject (`*` globs), why it is excepted, and whether the author
// must decide something (`ruling_needed`). Remove an entry once the source is fixed; an
// entry that matches nothing is reported as `exception-unused`.
